  "notes": "These SEND_MIDI bindings mock the layout only. Whether performance pads route through Python, a virtual MIDI port, or Bome to Ableton's DAW port is the deliberately deferred Phase 8 decision — MIDI input exclusivity on Windows is unsolved, not solved.",
